<view class="benefits-page"><view class="benefits-header"><text class="eyebrow">YOUR WELLNESS PRIVILEGES</text><text class="benefits-title">照顾自己，也积攒美好</text></view><view class="benefits-tabs"><button wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="key" class="benefits-tab {{tab === item.key ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="{{item.key}}" bindtap="switchTab">{{item.label}}</button></view>
<text wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="inline-error">{{errorMessage}}</text><status-view wx:if="{{loading}}" type="loading" title="正在读取账户权益"></status-view><status-view wx:elif="{{!summary}}" type="error" title="暂未获取账户信息" actionText="重新加载" bind:action="load"></status-view>
<block wx:else><view wx:if="{{tab === 'member'}}"><view class="membership-card"><text class="membership-brand">QI XIN MEMBER</text><text class="membership-tier">{{levelLabel}}</text><text class="membership-subtitle">每一次护理，都是对自己的认真关照。</text><view class="membership-points"><text>{{summary.points}}</text><text>账户积分</text></view></view><view class="benefits-note">会员等级与积分均来自账户记录。具体权益以门店实际配置为准，不承诺尚未配置的折扣或礼遇。</view></view>
<view wx:elif="{{tab === 'coupons'}}"><text class="section-title">我的优惠券</text><status-view wx:if="{{!owned.length}}" title="还没有优惠券" description="可在下方领取门店已发布的优惠券"></status-view><view wx:for="{{owned}}" wx:key="id" class="coupon-ticket {{item.status !== 'AVAILABLE' ? 'coupon-inactive' : ''}}"><view class="coupon-amount"><text>¥{{item.discountAmount}}</text><text>满 ¥{{item.minAmount}} 可用</text></view><view class="coupon-copy"><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.expiresAt}} 到期</text><text class="coupon-status">{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view></view><text class="section-title">可领取礼遇</text><status-view wx:if="{{!templates.length}}" title="暂无可领取优惠券" description="门店发布后会在这里展示"></status-view><view wx:for="{{templates}}" wx:key="id" class="coupon-ticket"><view class="coupon-amount"><text>¥{{item.discountAmount}}</text><text>满 ¥{{item.minAmount}} 可用</text></view><view class="coupon-copy"><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.expiresAt}} 到期</text><button class="claim-button" disabled="{{!!claiming || item.remaining <= 0}}" loading="{{claiming === item.id}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="claim">{{item.remaining > 0 ? '立即领取' : '已领完'}}</button></view></view></view>
<view wx:else>
  <view class="wallet-balance wallet-card"><text>测试余额</text><text>¥{{summary.walletBalance}}</text><text>仅用于开发体验，不代表真实资金。</text></view>
  <view class="benefits-note">账户余额以系统实时记录为准。订单支付金额与退款状态可在对应订单详情查看。</view>
  <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="load" disabled="{{loading}}">刷新余额</button>
  <button wx:if="{{summary.mockWalletEnabled}}" class="development-entry" bindtap="toggleTopup">{{showTopup ? '收起开发体验' : '开发体验：增加测试余额'}}</button>
  <view wx:if="{{showTopup && summary.mockWalletEnabled}}" class="wallet-form"><text class="section-title">增加测试余额</text><input type="digit" value="{{amount}}" bindinput="inputAmount" placeholder="输入测试金额" maxlength="8" /><button class="primary-button" loading="{{toppingUp}}" disabled="{{toppingUp}}" bindtap="topup">确认开发体验</button></view>
</view></block></view>